    "title": "Thoson MagTrack™",
    "body_html": "<p>The train set kids engineer themselves. MagTrack's modular magnetic tracks snap together into loops, bridges and brand-new routes. Then the motorized train takes the maiden run.</p><p>Design, test, fix, rebuild: every layout is a small engineering project that builds spatial reasoning and planning through hands-on STEM play. USB-rechargeable train, no screens anywhere.</p><p>Includes the motorized train and expandable magnetic track pieces. Recommended for ages 3 and up.</p>",
